---
<svg class="card-art" viewBox="0 0 320 180" role="img" aria-labelledby="art-bfm-t">
<title id="art-bfm-t">Two aircraft manoeuvring through adjacent turning circles, illustrating two-circle BFM flow.</title>
<rect class="frame" x=".5" y=".5" width="319" height="179"/>
<circle class="ln thin muted dashed" cx="113" cy="90" r="53"/>
<circle class="ln heavy" cx="207" cy="90" r="53"/>
<path class="ln" d="M113 37 l-9 -5 M113 37 l-9 6 M207 143 l9 -5 M207 143 l9 5"/>
<path class="accent-stroke" d="M260 90 A53 53 0 0 1 228 139 m11 -2 l-11 2 4 -11"/>
<path class="jet" d={jet} transform="translate(159 66) rotate(30) scale(1.35)"/>
<path class="jet muted" d={jet} transform="translate(161 114) rotate(210) scale(1.35)"/>
</svg>
